A '''Marquis''' (Japanese: '''マーキス''' ''Marquis'') is a type of [[Pokémon Trainer]] that debuted in [[Generation VI]]. This Trainer class is a title of nobility, granted in the [[Battle Chateau]], and Trainers with this class only appear there. Marquis is the fourth rank of nobility for males, ranking above {{tc|Earl}} and below {{tc|Duke}}. Its counterpart for females is {{tc|Marchioness}}.

The male [[player character]] may earn the title of Marquis by winning enough {{pkmn|battle}}s in the Battle Chateau. The male [[Gym Leader]]s of [[Kalos]] also hold the rank of Marquis in the Battle Chateau. All opponent Marquises use parties of two Pokémon, and all who are not Gym Leaders have Pokémon at level 40 (if no Writ of Challenge is active), while Gym Leaders' Pokémon have higher levels.

